		"change": "data-exchange-to-integriq",
		"adr": "ADR-037 modular manifest fragment, never edit src/manifest.json",
		"description": "GroupDataExchange after decision D7: a read-only status panel over integriq's exchange jobs and rejections owned by learniq, next to the pages of the exchange gate's own records (partner approvals, teldatum checks, parent reviews) and the export request screen."
	},
